{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"kitchen","model_identifier":"kitchen","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# kitchen\n\nKitchen (tier 3): a timber-frame kitchen house with two chimneys, a lean-to over a bread oven, a hanging sign.\n\n- Footprint: 8 x 6 columns (128 x 96 units, 3.60 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -58..81, y 0..142, z -44..38 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 89, construction_0 52, construction_33 63, construction_66 79, ruined 52 (8 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 96 x 132 x 64 centred at x -4, z 2\n- oven: 26 x 28 x 30 at x 63, z -1\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `kitchen_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `kitchen_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_kitchen` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 2.4 | loop | `sign` swings. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (-16, 0, -39)\n- `fx_smoke` at (-34, 143, 2)\n- `fx_smoke_2` at (28, 143, 2)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"k_found","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-54.0,0.0,-32.0],"to":[46.0,3.0,36.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,439.0,100.0,442.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[98.0,442.0,166.0,445.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,439.0,100.0,442.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[98.0,442.0,166.0,445.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[35.0,152.0,135.0,220.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[35.0,152.0,135.0,220.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"83dba712-99f7-5e63-896d-c72f5bf7550d"},{"name":"k_w0_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.0,3.0,-30.0],"to":[44.0,87.0,-26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,112.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[168.0,0.0,172.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,112.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[168.0,0.0,172.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[44.0,422.0,140.0,426.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[44.0,422.0,140.0,426.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"572ae6d4-8026-5bdc-8d96-6bbb1518d73b"},{"name":"k_w0_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-52.0,3.0,30.0],"to":[44.0,87.0,34.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,112.0,84.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[172.0,0.0,176.0,84.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,112.0,84.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[172.0,0.0,176.0,84.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[140.0,422.0,236.0,426.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[140.0,422.0,236.0,426.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"62057e41-fb28-52ff-8f